{"id":"609508","name":"豆腐渣面饼","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/609508/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"200克"},{"name":"豆腐渣","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"橄榄油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"腌","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"破壁机打豆浆，自己在家做豆腐脑。","img":"images/609508/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"过滤的豆腐渣。","img":"images/609508/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入面粉。","img":"images/609508/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"和成偏软一点的面团，醒20分钟。","img":"images/609508/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"面团不要揉，擀成薄薄的面饼，撒盐、橄榄油抹匀。","img":"images/609508/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"卷起来，分成均匀的剂子。","img":"images/609508/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"收口整理成圆形。","img":"images/609508/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"擀成面饼。","img":"images/609508/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"面饼放入平底锅，小火慢慢烙。","img":"images/609508/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"中间反面，熟透。","img":"images/609508/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/609508/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"豆香浓郁，柔软好吃。","img":"images/609508/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}